    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>On&nbsp;April 14, 2021, the following updates and enhancements were made to&nbsp;Azure SQL Managed Instance:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-sql/managed-instance/connectivity-architecture-overview#user-defined-routes-with-service-aided-subnet-configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Service-aided subnet configuration for Azure SQL Managed Instance now&nbsp;makes use of&nbsp;service tags&nbsp;for user-defined routes&nbsp;</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "On April 14, 2021, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL Managed Instance:\n\nService-aided subnet configuration for Azure SQL Managed Instance now makes use of service tags for user-defined routes"
  },
